# LibreTranslate  | none             | 200/min          | n/a          | active
# Wikipedia       | none             | unlimited        | n/a          | active
# ExchangeRate    | none             | unlimited        | n/a          | active
# DuckDuckGo      | none             | unlimited        | n/a          | active
# Geoapify        | optional key     | 3,000/day        | NO           | active
# SeatGeek        | optional key     | free             | NO           | optional (event_search)
# Ticketmaster    | REMOVED          | n/a              | n/a          | removed (signup friction)
