# ────────────────┴──────────────────┴──────────────────┴──────────────┴────────
# VERDICT: You can get every key Otto uses without entering a credit card
# anywhere. The only paid providers (Telnyx/Twilio for SMS) are clearly marked
# optional and entered per-user in the app — the developer never needs them.
